          INTERRUPTION, LOSS OF DATA, OR COST OF SUBSTITUTE SERVICES) ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE USE OR
          INABILITY TO USE THE SERVICE.</strong
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        TO THE EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, OUR TOTAL AGGREGATE LIABILITY TO YOU FOR ALL CLAIMS ARISING OUT OF OR RELATING
        TO THESE TERMS OR THE SERVICE SHALL BE STRICTLY LIMITED TO THE GREATER OF (A) THE TOTAL AMOUNT YOU PAID TO US IN
        THE TWELVE (12) MONTHS PRECEDING THE CLAIM, OR (B) TEN BRITISH POUNDS STERLING (£10.00 GBP).
      </p>

      <h2>10. Indemnification</h2>
      <p>
        You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless Unforgettable Management Ltd, its directors, officers,
        employees, and agents from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, costs, or expenses (including
        reasonable legal fees) arising out of or related to your breach of these Terms, your use or misuse of the
        Service, or your violation of any third-party rights.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Modifications to Service & Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to modify, enhance, restrict, suspend, or discontinue any aspect of the Service at any time
        with or without notice. We may update these Terms from time to time. When changes are made, the "Last Updated"
