        <p class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 mb-1">Unforgettable Management Ltd</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">Registered in England and Wales</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-0">
          Website: <a href="https://www.123todo.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">www.123todo.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800">
        <p class="font-bold mb-2 text-blue-950 dark:text-blue-100 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>💾</span> Reminder: Protect Your Data with Regular Exports
        </p>
        <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 leading-relaxed">
          123 ToDo stores all data directly on your device. We do not maintain server-side copies. Clearing your browser
          storage or losing your device will permanently erase your local data.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 leading-relaxed mb-0">
          <strong>Best Practice:</strong> Go to <strong>Settings ⚙️ ➔ Import / Export Data</strong> regularly to download
          a free 1-click JSON backup to your computer, hard drive, or personal cloud.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
